# Pre-purge snapshot of seeded rows (see sql/002_remove_test_data.sql). Local
# safety net only; delete once the purge is verified on every environment.
.purge-backup.json
# Uploaded product images are user content and stay out of the repo, but the
# seed references uploads/iphone.png as the placeholder for every product, so
# that one file has to be tracked or a fresh clone renders no images at all.
uploads/*
!uploads/.gitkeep
!uploads/iphone.png
